Error: Jet.PrivateItem: `message` is private to its module
  --> Tests/UI/core_failure_record_literal_user.jet:2:47
    |
  2 | failure: fn() -> TextError Never! { TextError{message: "invalid"} }
    |                                               ^^^^^^^
 Why: A `priv module` is usable only by its enclosing module (`priv(package)`: by its package), and a `priv` field only by its type's module
 Fix: Use `message` from inside its module, or remove `priv` from its module or field
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.PrivateItem
